{"title": "Quant Super Practice — Mock #7", "duration_min": 10.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If x = (&radic;6 + 2) and y =(&radic;6 &#8722; 2), then what is the value of (&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x", "q_hi": "<p><div><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = (&radic;6 + 2) &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; y =(&radic;6 &#8722; 2) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379;(&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x", "options_en": ["42", "97", "35", "22"], "options_hi": ["42", "97", "35", "22"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Compute x/y:</p><p>Multiply numerator and denominator by (&radic;6 + 2):</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x/y = ( (&radic;6 + 2)&#178; ) / ( (&radic;6)&#178; &#8722; 2&#178; )</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;= (6 + 4&radic;6 + 4) / (6 &#8722; 4)</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;= (10 + 4&radic;6) / 2 = 5 + 2&radic;6.</p><p>Similarly, compute y/x:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;y/x = 5 &#8722; 2&radic;6.</p><p>Sum the two:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x/y + y/x = (5 + 2&radic;6) + (5 &#8722; 2&radic;6) = 10.</p><p>Then, (x/y + y/x)&#178; &#8722; 3 = 10&#178; &#8722; 3 = 100 &#8722; 3 = 97.</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Compute x/y:</p><p>Multiply numerator and denominator by (&radic;6 + 2):</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x/y = ( (&radic;6 + 2)&#178; ) / ( (&radic;6)&#178; &#8722; 2&#178; )</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;= (6 + 4&radic;6 + 4) / (6 &#8722; 4)</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;&#8195;= (10 + 4&radic;6) / 2 = 5 + 2&radic;6.</p><p>Similarly, compute y/x:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;y/x = 5 &#8722; 2&radic;6.</p><p>Sum the two:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x/y + y/x = (5 + 2&radic;6) + (5 &#8722; 2&radic;6) = 10.</p><p>Then, (x/y + y/x)&#178; &#8722; 3 = 10&#178; &#8722; 3 = 100 &#8722; 3 = 97.</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;Find the simplified form of:&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a<sup>5</sup> b<sup>3</sup> c<sup>7</sup>", "q_hi": "<p><div>&nbsp;&#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a<sup>5</sup> b<sup>3</sup> c<sup>7</sup>", "options_en": ["(a<sup>1</sup>)  X  (b<sup>-5</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-2</sup>)", "(a<sup>-3</sup>)  X  (b<sup>-10</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-4</sup>)", "(a<sup>-1</sup>)  X  (b<sup>4</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-5</sup>)", "(a<sup>6</sup>)  X  (b<sup>6</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-4</sup>)"], "options_hi": ["(a<sup>1</sup>)  X  (b<sup>-5</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-2</sup>)", "(a<sup>-3</sup>)  X  (b<sup>-10</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-4</sup>)", "(a<sup>-1</sup>)  X  (b<sup>4</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-5</sup>)", "(a<sup>6</sup>)  X  (b<sup>6</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-4</sup>)"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p><img width=88 height=59 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27838/image006.png\"></p><p><img width=115 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27838/image007.png\"></p><p><img width=93 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27838/image008.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=88 height=59 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27838/image006.png\"></p><p><img width=115 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27838/image007.png\"></p><p><img width=93 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p27838/image008.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify:</p><p>(&#8731; [&#8731; 343])<sup>3</sup> x (&#8731; [&#8731; 216])<sup>3</sup></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&