07 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24263/image063.png\"></p><p><img width=131 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24263/image064.png\"></p><p><img width=92 height=52 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24263/image065.png\"></p><p><img width=207 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24263/image066.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&#8731;6589", "q_hi": "<p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">&#8731;6589", "options_en": ["7", "16", "-3", "17"], "options_hi": ["7", "16", "-3", "17"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>&#8731;6859 = 19 (19<sup>3</sup> = 6859)</p><p>&radic;1296 = &radic;36 =6</p><p>(19 / 6)  X  (3 / 57)  X  42</p><p>= 42/6 = 7</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>&#8731;6859 = 19 (19<sup>3</sup> = 6859)</p><p>&radic;1296 = &radic;36 =6</p><p>(19 / 6)  X  (3 / 57)  X  42</p><p>= 42/6 = 7</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a<sup>7</sup>  b<sup>8</sup>  c<sup>7</sup>", "q_hi": "<p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a<sup>7</sup>  b<sup>8</sup>  c<sup>7</sup>", "options_en": ["(a<sup>0</sup>)  X  (b<sup>2</sup>)  X  (c<sup>1</sup>)", "(a<sup>-7</sup>)  X  (b<sup>2</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-4</sup>)", "(a<sup>-2</sup>)  X  (b<sup>3</sup>)  X  (c<sup>3</sup>)", "(a<sup>-5</sup>)  X  (b<sup>-8</sup>)  X  (c<sup>0</sup>)"], "options_hi": ["(a<sup>0</sup>)  X  (b<sup>2</sup>)  X  (c<sup>1</sup>)", "(a<sup>-7</sup>)  X  (b<sup>2</sup>)  X  (c<sup>-4</sup>)", "(a<sup>-2</sup>)  X  (b<sup>3</sup>)  X  (c<sup>3</sup>)", "(a<sup>-5</sup>)  X  (b<sup>-8</sup>)  X  (c<sup>0</sup>)"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>We need to simplify the expression (a<sup>7</sup>  X  b<sup>8</sup>  X  c<sup>7</sup>)/(a<sup>9</sup>  X  b<sup>5</sup> X  c<sup>4</sup>). Using the exponent rule for division, when dividing terms with the same base, subtract the exponents:</p><p>For a: a<sup>7</sup> / a<sup>9</sup> = a<sup>(7-9)</sup> = a<sup>-2</sup></p><p>For b: b<sup>8</sup> / b<sup>5</sup> = b<sup>(8 - 5)</sup> = b<sup>3</sup></p><p>For c: c<sup>7</sup> / c<sup>4</sup> = c<sup>(7 - 4)</sup> = c<sup>3</sup></p><p>So, the expression becomes:</p><p>a<sup>-2</sup>  X  b<sup>3</sup>  X  c<sup>3</sup></p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We need to simplify the expression (a<sup>7</sup>  X  b<sup>8</sup>  X  c<sup>7</sup>)/(a<sup>9</sup>  X  b<sup>5</sup> X  c<sup>4</sup>). Using the exponent rule for division, when dividing terms with the same base, subtract the exponents:</p><p>For a: a<sup>7</sup> / a<sup>9</sup> = a<sup>(7-9)</sup> = a<sup>-2</sup></p><p>For b: b<sup>8</sup> / b<sup>5</sup> = b<sup>(8 - 5)</sup> = b<sup>3</sup></p><p>For c: c<sup>7</sup> / c<sup>4</sup> = c<sup>(7 - 4)</sup> = c<sup>3</sup></p><p>So, the expression becomes:</p><p>a<sup>-2</sup>  X  b<sup>3</sup>  X  c<sup>3</sup></p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If 2<sup>x</sup>+ 3<sup>y</sup> = 17 and 2<sup>x+2</sup> - 3<sup>y+1</sup> = 5, then:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2<sup>x</sup>+ 3<sup>y</sup> = 17 &#2324;&#2352; 2<sup>x+2</sup> - 3<sup>y+1</sup> = 5 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379;:</p>", "options_en": ["x = 1, y = 3", "x = 3, y = 3", "x = 3, y = 2", "x = 1, y = 2"], "options_hi": ["x = 1, y = 3", "x = 3, y = 3", "x = 3, y = 2", "x = 1, y = 2"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>2<sup>x+2</sup> - 3<sup>y+1</sup> = 5</p><p>2<sup>x </sup>*2<sup>2</sup> - 3<sup>y</sup>*3<sup>1</sup> = 5</p><p>4*2<sup>x</sup>  -  3*3<sup>y</sup> = 5 ---------(1)</p><p>and 2<sup>x</sup> + 3<sup>y</sup> = 17----------(2)</p><p>On solving equation (1) and (2) -</p><p>2<sup>x</sup> = 8 = 2<sup>3</sup>&rarr; x = 3</p><p>3<sup>y</sup> = 9 = 3<sup>2</sup>&rarr; y = 2</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>2<sup>x+2</sup> - 3<sup>y+1</sup> = 5</p><p>2<sup>x </sup>*2<sup>2</sup> - 3<sup>y</sup>*3<sup>1</sup> = 5</p><p>4*2<sup>x</sup>  -  3*3<sup>y</sup> = 5 ---------(1)</p><p>and 2<sup>x</sup> + 3<sup>y</sup> = 17----------(2)</p><p>On solving equation (1) and (2) -</p><p>2<sup>x</sup> = 8 = 2<sup>3</sup>&rarr; x = 3</p><p>3<sup>y</sup> = 9 = 3<sup>2</sup>&rarr; y = 2</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}]}